WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:02.211
As a journalist,

00:00:02.211 --> 00:00:04.963
when I came across
something horrific,

00:00:05.214 --> 00:00:07.257
something I wanted to
turn away from,

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:08.842
I couldn’t.

00:00:10.636 --> 00:00:12.054
I hope you'll follow me.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.306
However dark it may be.

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:17.434
"Truth be Told," deals
with the themes of

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.811
truth and justice
throughout the seasons.

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:20.854
This season,

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:23.690
the cases surround
missing girls

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.860
and the truth about
why they'd go missing.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.862
Who gets national
media coverage.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.364
Who gets media
coverage at all.

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:32.658
"Truth be Told."

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:33.951
Telling the truth is actually

00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:35.869
one of the hardest
things for most people.

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:38.747
In season 3, I play a
high school principal

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:40.249
where a number of her students

00:00:40.249 --> 00:00:41.667
are being trafficked.

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:44.169
So this season,
Poppy's podcast

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:46.213
is solving some
of the crimes

00:00:46.213 --> 00:00:47.506
against these girls.

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:49.800
Poppy has to deal with

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.427
how much of the truth
she wants to tell.

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:55.973
Justice doesn't always
have truth in it.

00:00:55.973 --> 00:00:58.141
I think we explore
that beautifully.

00:00:58.141 --> 00:01:00.769
The more Poppy delves into

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:03.146
Drea's case the more she
realizes that

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:05.983
sex trafficking is a huge issue.

00:01:06.692 --> 00:01:09.027
We're dealing with
topics that are

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:11.113
very relevant in
today's society.

00:01:12.114 --> 00:01:14.074
You see things that
other people can't.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:16.326
I'll get a few of my guys to
help me do some digging.

00:01:16.326 --> 00:01:18.161
There's so many new dynamics.

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:19.413
We've really pushed
the envelope.

00:01:20.122 --> 00:01:21.290
We delved into

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:22.249
a very real problem

00:01:22.249 --> 00:01:24.793
in a very authentic way.

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:25.502
Gabrielle--

00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:27.462
I feel extremely blessed

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:29.089
to be working opposite.

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:31.091
When we first meet Eva

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:33.927
there's a mysteriousness
around her.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:35.721
I hope I didn't get
you into trouble.

00:01:35.721 --> 00:01:36.722
Only the good kind.

00:01:37.222 --> 00:01:41.351
Poppy has to question, is
she a friend or foe.

00:01:41.351 --> 00:01:43.937
They each come with a
host of secrets.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:46.982
There's a constant
push and pull between the two of

00:01:46.982 --> 00:01:50.485
them that makes their
relationship very combustible.

00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:52.529
Some untruths are worth it.

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:54.990
This could ruin
my entire career.

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.450
We can't let them
get away with this.

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:57.617
I know.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:58.577
Do you?

00:01:58.577 --> 00:02:01.455
Their approach to the same goal

00:02:01.455 --> 00:02:03.290
is just kind of wildly
different.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:05.042
That's the beauty, I
think, of season 3--

00:02:05.042 --> 00:02:06.209
that it's not obvious.

00:02:06.209 --> 00:02:07.794
There's mysteries within
the mysteries.

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:11.298
We're constantly playing in
these emotional playgrounds

00:02:11.298 --> 00:02:13.967
and just trying to peel back
more and more layers.

00:02:14.551 --> 00:02:16.678
I'm excited for people to see

00:02:16.678 --> 00:02:18.764
the growth in all the
characters.

00:02:18.764 --> 00:02:22.059
Season 3 gives us all an
opportunity to really explore

00:02:22.059 --> 00:02:23.894
some of the personal
ups and downs

00:02:23.894 --> 00:02:25.270
the characters are
going through.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.439
It's a really expansive story,
but at its heart

00:02:27.439 --> 00:02:28.899
is the dynamic of family.

00:02:28.899 --> 00:02:31.068
There's a texture
and a grit to it.

00:02:31.068 --> 00:02:32.778
It's really moving
to be a part of.

00:02:32.778 --> 00:02:34.112
We get to laugh with them,

00:02:34.112 --> 00:02:36.323
we get to cry with them,
we get to mourn with them.

00:02:36.323 --> 00:02:37.616
The truth is messy,

00:02:37.616 --> 00:02:38.658
it can be a little painful,

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:39.576
it can be dark.

00:02:39.576 --> 00:02:42.245
But also gives us
glimmers of hope

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:44.373
which is all that we
can really ask for.

00:02:49.336 --> 00:02:51.838
♪♪

